{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319000/extras/aggrolotls_title.gif?t=1743609624\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aggrolotls is an arena roguelite from top-down perspective where you are playing as tiny axolotls and have to evolve into a swarm that can take on powerful creatures from the see. Level up and pick from Upgrades that make each round feel unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319000/extras/aggrolotls_upgrade.gif?t=1743609624\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Killing enemies gives you experience, which you need to level up your swarm. As you defeat bosses, you will gain access to special upgrades that change the gameplay even more drastically. This allows you to discover different builds to overcome the challenges the sea has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3319000/extras/aggrolotls_boss_v4.gif?t=1743609624\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Into the Depths 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3319000/a488da893cf4b5ce0d7752d326ec058ce4163ff3.jpg"},{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3319000/b9913ad3905ab4060a774e470ed87429fd990922.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Depths 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3319000/108138a71b760e4201514e7676e324c23a3e1f35.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Depths 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3319000/870eaf37c2d8cfbc75830b1123ab6e34b04b5baa.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Depths 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3319000/447e3254e39744eb42b930a924567a180a33eac7.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Depths 5",